2. Exercise content and images — CC BY-SA 4.0
   Applies to: the exercise names, target areas, equipment and "how to" notes
   adapted from the wger exercise database (https://wger.de), and the images in
   img/. Each exercise lists its wger id, author and original license
   (CC-BY-SA 4.0, CC-BY-SA 3.0 or CC0) on the page and in
   src/js/data-exercises.js. Our adaptations are licensed under
   Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0:
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
   Changes made: English text rewritten as Chinese summaries.

3. Other data
   - Food nutrition values: USDA FoodData Central (SR Legacy), public domain.
     FDC ids are kept in the source.
   - Health notes are rewritten in Chinese from public NHS and WHO pages; each
     entry links to its source page. Those sources keep their own terms.
